= SKD Load Layers =

"""Loads what the other departments of a shot have published."""

Each row is a department. Untick a row to work without it.

A row reads the department's current version, so a new publish reaches this hip when it is next opened or reloaded. Choose a version in a row's menu to pin it: the row reads that version until the menu is set back to Current. Pinned rows are listed in the node's comment. A row pinned to a version that is no longer published for the shot is an error on this node, naming the row and the version: choose another version in its menu, or untick the row.

@inputs

Input Stage:
    The layers are added on top of this stage.

@parameters

Shot Directory:
    #id: shot
    The shot whose layers are loaded.

Reload:
    #id: reload
    Reads every row's layer from disk again.
